{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a high school girl stranded on a deserted island. Craft tools, find food, and strive to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience realistic survival with parameters like hydration, sleep, and illness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island's layout changes each time you play, offering fresh strategies with every run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings and story scenarios are included.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're free to ignore the story and play however you like.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each run, your score is displayed and ranked online against other players.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3840250?t=1757860392","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840250/db2d0917250e268d454d7569b9f3e6010f2935ed/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757860392","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840250/753ca3e830b087a13ac1ccb579c97e72a6104259/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757860392","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840250/753ca3e830b087a13ac1ccb579c97e72a6104259/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757860392","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a high school girl stranded on a deserted island. Craft tools, find food, and strive to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience realistic survival with param